---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="PostPulsar - Automate Your Content"
  description="Turn one blog post into content for all your social networks with one click."
>
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold md:text-6xl">
          Stop Doing Manual Work. Multiply Your Content.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          PostPulsar automatically transforms your blog articles into Twitter
          threads, LinkedIn posts, and Instagram images.
        </p>
        <div id="cta-buttons" class="mt-8 flex justify-center space-x-4">
          <a
            href="/signup"
            class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg transition-transform transform hover:scale-105"
            data-auth="false">Get Started for Free</a
          >
          <a
            href="/app"
            class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg transition-transform transform hover:scale-105"
            data-auth="true"
            style="display: none;">Go to Dashboard</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problem Section -->
    <section class="py-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800">
          The Hell of Repurposing Content
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          You spend hours writing an amazing article. But for it to reach its
          audience, you need to spend even more hours slicing, adapting, and
          manually posting on each social network. It's repetitive work that
          drains your energy and stops you from creating.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Solution Section -->
    <section class="bg-gray-100 py-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800">
          Your Personal Content Machine
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Paste your article's URL and let our AI do the heavy lifting. In
          minutes, you'll have a complete set of posts for your social networks,
          ready to be reviewed and scheduled. More reach, less effort.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
